<Legal title="Cookie Policy" description="Cookies and browser storage used on the Spending Atlas website and app.">
  <p>
    Cookies and similar browser storage (localStorage, IndexedDB) let a website save small pieces of information on your device. Spending Atlas uses them only to make the site and
    the app work.
  </p>

  <h2>What we use</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>ha-cerez-onayi</td><td>Essential (preference)</td><td>Remembering whether you accepted or rejected analytics</td><td>Until you delete it</td></tr>
      <tr><td>ha-site-theme</td><td>Essential (preference)</td><td>Remembering your light or dark theme choice</td><td>Until you delete it</td></tr>
      <tr><td>sb-…-auth-token</td><td>Essential</td><td>Keeping you signed in if you signed in</td><td>Until you sign out</td></tr>
      <tr><td>App database (IndexedDB)</td><td>Essential</td><td>Keeping your records on the device and working offline</td><td>Until you delete it</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Paddle cookies</td><td>Essential (third party)</td><td>Only on the checkout page, to complete payment securely and prevent fraud</td><td>As set by Paddle</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Cloudflare</td><td>Essential (third party)</td><td>Protecting the site against attacks</td><td>For the session</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>Essential cookies do not require consent. We do not use advertising cookies.</p>

  <h2>Analytics cookies (only with consent)</h2>
  <p>
    To improve the site we may collect visit statistics with PostHog (EU server): which pages are opened, where visitors come from, device and browser type. This only starts if
    you choose “Accept” in the box at the bottom of the screen, and it uses a cookie named <code>ph_…</code> and browser storage (up to 1 year). Sessions are not recorded and
    financial records in the app are never included. You can change your decision at any time via the “Cookie preferences” link at the bottom of the page.
  </p>

  <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
  <p>
    You can delete or block cookies and site data in your browser settings. If you block essential ones, parts such as sign-in and checkout may not work. For more on your
    personal data, see the <a href="/en/legal/kvkk">KVKK Privacy Notice</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
